# `lint-staged`, not `npx lint-staged`. `_/h` puts `node_modules/.bin` on PATH, so the
# bare command resolves with no registry round trip, and exits 127 when it cannot —
# which husky reports by name. `npx` in a tree with no install fetches the package
# instead: 70 seconds before failing when the registry is unreachable, and a silent
# download when it is not.
lint-staged
npm run tsc
npm run test
